   * @x-autobe-authorization-actor member
   * @x-autobe-specification Query the hrm_platform_member_sessions table by session ID (UUID). Validate the session exists and is not expired. Check authorization: allow access if the requesting member owns this session (hrm_platform_member_id matches current user) or if the user has org:manage permission in the current organization context. Return session details including id, hrm_platform_member_id, ip, href, referrer, created_at, and expired_at fields. If session not found or access denied, return 404 or 403 error respectively. Apply organization context filtering to ensure data isolation.
   * @nestia Generated by Nestia - https://github.com/samchon/nestia
   */
  @TypedRoute.Get(":sessionId")
  public async at(
