   * @x-autobe-authorization-actor member
   * @x-autobe-specification Query organization memberships for the current authenticated user by joining member organizations table with hrm_platform_organizations. Apply search filters on organization name (partial match, case-insensitive), creation date range, and status (active only, exclude soft-deleted). Implement cursor-based or offset pagination with configurable page size (default 20, max 100). Support sorting by name, created_at, and timezone. Return organization summary objects containing id, name, description, logo_url, currency, timezone, fiscal_start_month, and created_at. Enforce organization context isolation - only return organizations where the current user has membership. Validate user authentication before processing. Handle pagination tokens for cursor-based navigation if implemented.
   * @nestia Generated by Nestia - https://github.com/samchon/nestia
   */
  @TypedRoute.Patch()
  public async index(
    @MemberAuth()
    member: MemberPayload,
    @TypedBody()
